// farsi-tts-gui resources.
//
// Embedding the Common Controls v6 manifest is what gives every button,
// trackbar, combo and progress bar the modern (themed) look instead of the
// Windows-95 classic style, plus DPI awareness and the Windows 7
// compatibility tag. MSVC gets the same manifest through CMake's
// /MANIFESTINPUT (see CMakeLists.txt); MinGW needs it as a resource, which
// is what this file is for (windres: 24 = RT_MANIFEST, id 1 = the first
// (application) manifest).
1 24 "win7.manifest"
